What matters before reading a conversation: the person, whether you owe a reply, open promises, and the gist and ask from a model.

Facts come from the local store. The gist and ask need a configured model; `--no-ai` skips them.

Usage: mxr briefing context [OPTIONS] <THREAD_ID>

Arguments:
  <THREAD_ID>


Options:
      --no-ai
          Facts from the local store only; don't ask the model

      --refresh
          Ask the model again instead of using the cached gist

      --format <FORMAT>
          [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
